      answer: 'If you need hands on coding capacity, hire or contract a senior developer. If you need someone to own technology decisions, vendors, security and the roadmap, but not five days a week, a fractional CTO fits. If technology is the core of the product, you have an engineering team of several people, and decisions are needed daily, it is time for a full time CTO, and a fractional CTO can help you hire one.',
